    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a SmartTools map user",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want to view the details for a Ping point",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So that I can investigate latency at the selected location.",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Issue/Change Description:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "When a user opens a Ping point through the shared point-detail dialog, display Ping Time in milliseconds and the attributes returned for that selected point."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Ping detail view must work when 5G NSA is the only selected technology. Point selection, dialog behaviour, and the mini-map are covered by the preceding shared stories."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance Criteria:",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given a Ping point is selected and its details load, Ping Time is shown in milliseconds for that selected point."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given Ping attributes are available, they are displayed alongside Ping Time in the standard point-detail presentation."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given 5G NSA is the only selected technology, when the user opens a Ping point, the point details open without error and show the selected point’s data."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Given Ping details are loading, unavailable, or fail to load, a standard loading, no-data, or error state is shown without displaying incorrect data."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
